{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-94"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816680-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 발을 헛디뎌 수거장의 인력 슬라이드에 떨어진다. 허름한 기계와 폐기된 부속품이 강물처럼 앞으로 밀어내는 바람에 당신은 굴뚝에서 밝은 방으로 떨어진다","talkId":403816680,"textHash":"10325507949469121295","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/talk-403816680","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"dc40a7f3c5252515","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816681-line"],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816681-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"수리공의 수염은 톱니바퀴와 광물 부스러기로 덮여 있다. 그는 냉각된 항성으로 만든 망토를 두르고 있어서 마법사처럼 보인다","talkId":403816681,"textHash":"13525471740674943776","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/talk-403816681","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"dc40a7f3c5252515","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816682-line"],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816682-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「얘야, 원하는 게 있느냐?」 노인은 빠르거나 느리지 않게 쥐고 있던 플라스틱 장난감을 내려놓고 탁한 눈동자로 당신을 부드럽게 바라본다. 진열장에는 중력반과 엔진 파편, 흰색 라텍스를 이어 붙여 만든 기괴한 장난감이 놓여 있다","talkId":403816682,"textHash":"16608141693524916194","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/talk-403816682","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"dc40a7f3c5252515","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816683-line"],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816683-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「원한다면 가져가렴. 물론 너도 쓸모없는 폐품을 두고 가도 돼. 장담하는데, 다음에 그걸 보게 되면 깜짝 놀랄 거야」","talkId":403816683,"textHash":"10412071379887011133","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/talk-403816683","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"dc40a7f3c5252515","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-text-14737015212358923076-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"지니고 다니던 플라스틱 장식을 남겨둔다","talkId":null,"textHash":"14737015212358923076","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/text-14737015212358923076","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"47a9ebdcc19a5684","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-text-11079877248847834447-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"녹슨 금속 부품을 남겨둔다","talkId":null,"textHash":"11079877248847834447","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/text-11079877248847834447","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c8ad6da7a861a9f9","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-text-9835737114266437207-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"폐기된 전자기기를 남겨둔다","talkId":null,"textHash":"9835737114266437207","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/text-9835737114266437207","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0b85ec1485e6fba6","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816684-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-94","missionId":"event-rogue-94","mission":"수리공 (1)","scene":"수리공 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"노인은 오랜만에 만난 친구와 작별하듯, 미소를 지으며 당신에게 작별 인사를 건넨다","talkId":403816684,"textHash":"8016169294715367242","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:94/talk-403816684","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5957b000a4b5cfe5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其一）","bwikiRevision":58260,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14333","bwikiMission":"수리공 (1)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816680-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816681-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816682-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816683-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-text-14737015212358923076-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-text-11079877248847834447-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-text-9835737114266437207-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-94-talk-403816684-line"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":8,"reviewRows":0,"segments":5,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}